{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-08_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-08","title":"不做約定","storyCode":"2-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"426bb637546ecc7785be671002e849b9b18b25ddae47196264d49f047ddab81f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡，雷蛇，注意警戒四周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶米莎去見陳長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們又遲到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"別給龍門增加多餘的安全隱患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，整合運動多次襲擊我們的護送隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，敵人仍在我們周圍徘徊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡並不安全，請趕快帶米莎離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是米莎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"從現在起，你必須聽從近衛局的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"PC94172，看好這孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，這個孩子，我不知道龍門究竟需要她做什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我希望龍門能保護好她的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門對感染者已經很寬厚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但米莎的身體狀況並不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望龍門在解決事件後，能讓米莎在羅德島生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——我會向魏長官申請的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"檢查後如果沒有其他問題，龍門就會把她移交給羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果，真的沒有問題的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"用不了太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......就在這裡暫時告別吧，米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島歡迎你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我不在這段時間裡，請你保護貧民區的孩子們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦，明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！我答應你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我說，米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"以後可以教我......怎麼做娃娃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的任務就這樣結束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"牽扯的事情越多，羅德島越會陷入被動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"但龍門還把我們蒙在鼓裡呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門對我們很冷淡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"但整合運動可是十分熱情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人想要攻擊我們所在的街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然早有耳聞，但龍門的建築風格，果然很複雜呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是條街，卻建在樓頂....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"完全是讓敵人有機可乘嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"又是整合運動......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——追到這裡來了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他們究竟要米莎......做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局隊員"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙蘭卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["芙蘭卡","雷蛇"]}]}
